id: pm-gh1580
title: "GH-1580: Host-bound extension settings sections"
description: "SDK: no supported reader for an extension's own settings section, so packages re-read settings.json by path and lose their configuration on non-filesystem backends"
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 2
